    "Nothing logged today yet. Tell me what you spent?": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ມື້ນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກຫຍັງເລີຍ ໃຊ້ຫຍັງໄປແດ່ ເລົ່າໃຫ້ຟັງແດ່?"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
